                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">900783cc-44a6-4b33-87d7-8c360e5f3873</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PROCEDURA</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">30 | SIMPLE BRIDGE ANIMA PIENA | CURVO R=250 m
Geometria in mm: campate 30+40+30 m, tre travi a -4/0/+4 m, soletta 12 m x 250 mm.
Modifica i pannelli: appoggi, interassi, quote, conci, traversi, passo soletta. Nessun carico o analisi.
Il concio 24-36 m attraversa la pila a 30 m. Il giunto aggiuntivo a 18 m interessa solo G2.
Members + Member IDs hanno gli stessi percorsi. Famiglie: 0 travi, 1 traversi pieni, 2/3 correnti, 4 montanti, 5 diagonali.
Deck Beams: soletta a metà spessore; Deck Connections -&gt; Bridge Connections mode 0 per link rigidi.
Grillage Geometry include la famiglia 8: assegnare esplicitamente una proprietà cls. Bridge Geometry mantiene la sola carpenteria.</item>
                  </items>
